    "solution": "Parry the shielded guard, then jump as you cut the staggered guard. His fall opens the beam onto the sealed tally. Dash up-left to the raised western shelf and land safely above the beam. Hop, dash down-right onto that shelf, and jump after the ground contact has returned the dash: the wavedash carries you low beneath the teeth and over the exposed beam. Spend the returned dash up-right into the receiving shelf, then walk out.",
