    "designNotes": "Geometry and entity settings are unchanged. The recorded intended route follows the player’s parry/retreat/wavedash/final-dash solution. A jump-cut after the parry is included because parry staggers the guard and the blade removes its beam-blocking body. The previous back-cut route remains an allowed alternative; it no longer defines the preview. No hidden technique gate was added.",
